<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体">朱刚（复旦大学教授）<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%B1%89" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>汉</SPAN></SPAN></A><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%97%8F" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>族</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>，<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%B5%99%E6%B1%9F" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>浙江</SPAN></SPAN></A><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%BB%8D%E5%85%B4" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>绍兴</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>人。<st1:chsdate w:st="on" IsROCDate="False" IsLunarDate="False" Day="6" Month="6" Year="1969"><SPAN lang=EN-US>1969</SPAN>年<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>6</SPAN>日</st1:chsdate>生，<SPAN lang=EN-US>1987</SPAN>年考入<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%A4%8D%E6%97%A6%E5%A4%A7%E5%AD%A6" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>复旦大学</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>中文系，<SPAN lang=EN-US>1997</SPAN>年师从<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E7%8E%8B%E6%B0%B4%E7%85%A7" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>王水照</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>先生获<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%8D%9A%E5%A3%AB" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>博士</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>学位，留系任教。现为古代文学教研室主任，教授，<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%AE%8B%E4%BB%A3%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6%E5%AD%A6%E4%BC%9A" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>中国宋代文学学会</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>副秘书长、《<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E5%AE%8B%E4%BB%A3%E6%96%87%E5%AD%A6%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E5%B9%B4%E9%89%B4" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>宋代文学研究年鉴</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>》编委、《新宋学》执编。<SPAN lang=EN-US>2012</SPAN>年起任复旦大学中文系副系主任。对中国历代人文文化的各领域皆有研习之兴趣，主要集中于<SPAN lang=EN-US><A href="https://baike.baidu.com/item/%E6%95%A6%E7%85%8C" target=_blank><SPAN lang=EN-US style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: windowtext; text-underline: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US>敦煌</SPAN></SPAN></A></SPAN>艺术与宋代文学两个方面。于敦煌艺术，关心佛教造形艺术的<SPAN lang=EN-US>“</SPAN>中国化<SPAN lang=EN-US>”</SPAN>问题；于宋代文学，则注重探讨宋代道学与文学思想之关系、宋代党争与文学流派之关系。</SPAN></P>
